abstract: >-
  Omni-MRL (v11.1) is a strictly non-clairvoyant (Zero-ML, Zero-Migration) AI/GPU cluster
  scheduler and Kubernetes v1.34 HTTP Extender prototype unifying discrete boundary protection,
  inspection-paradox bidirectional hazard gating (DFR/IFR), same-entry cohort Kaplan-Meier MRL
  reclamation with guaranteed non-negative tail hazard rate (R'(u) >= -1), heterogeneous
  Max-of-N attenuation, and rack-topology preservation. Evaluated on Lockbox 30-seed factorials,
  bias-corrected dual-oracle ML crossovers, and a 40.5M-job multi-trace empirical regime audit
  across Alibaba GPU-v2026, AcmeTrace Kalos, SenseTime Helios, and Alibaba PAI 2023.
